&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div id=&#34;gallery-fa0fcd9ea9b799c1545a43e687c34f49&#34; class=&#34;gallery&#34;&gt;
  
  
    
    
&lt;figure class=&#34;grid-w50 pb-4 text-center&#34;&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://mis3085.github.io/docs-acelon-yarn/app-4-01_9639139229101625560.jpg&#34; alt=&#34;Medical yarn for PPE and health care textiles&#34; class=&#34;mx-auto max-w-full h-auto&#34;/&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;Medical yarn for PPE and health care textiles&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;
&lt;figure class=&#34;grid-w50 pb-4 text-center&#34;&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://mis3085.github.io/docs-acelon-yarn/app-4-02_5278048625156746939.jpg&#34; alt=&#34;Far Infrared Thermal Fabric&#34; class=&#34;mx-auto max-w-full h-auto&#34;/&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;Far Infrared Thermal Fabric&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Medical yarns are essential in the production of textiles for personal protective equipment (PPE), rehabilitation gear, and a variety of health care applications. These specialized yarns are engineered to provide antibacterial properties, helping to prevent contamination and ensuring compliance with strict regulatory standards for safety and performance.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      
